      "content": "i know people want to help but they don't understand. they don't see the numbers. i've look at every option and the math just doesn't work. there's literally no way to back out of this debt or get the house back. it's like i'm just drowning and the more i swim the more exhausted i get. it feels like there's just a wall in front of me and it's not moving.",
