      "content": "i've already talked to people. they just give me these generic \"hang in there\" speeches. it doesn't change the fact that im bankrupt and my life is basically over. everything i worked for is just gone. it's not even a question of \"finding a path\" anymore, it's just that there is nothing left. it feels like the only way to actually stop the panic and the shame is to just... make it all stop. to just exit. why is it so hard for people to see that sometimes there really is no good way out?",
